{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 240,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- LEDs don't get their color\nfrom their plastic covers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3450,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can see that because\nhere is a transparent LED"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6720,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that also glows the same red color."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9270,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The color of the light comes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10530,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from the electronics themselves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12540,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The casing just helps us\ntell different LEDs apart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15720,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 1962, general Electric\nengineer Nick Holonyak"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19230,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "created the first visible LED."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21630,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It glowed a faint red."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23940,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A few years after that,\nengineers at Monsanto"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26580,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "created a green LED."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28950,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But for decades, all we\nhad were those two colors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32970,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So LEDs could only be used\nin things like indicators,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36480,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "calculators, and watches."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38550,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If only we could make\nblue, then we could mix"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41820,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "red, green, and blue to make white,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43890,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and every other color,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45390,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "unlocking LEDs for every type\nof lighting in the world,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48990,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from light bulbs, to phones, to computers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51570,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to TVs to billboards."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54000,
    "dDurationMs": 3989,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But blue was almost impossible to make."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57989,
    "dDurationMs": 2071,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(dramatic music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60060,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Throughout the 1960s,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61830,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "every big electronics\ncompany in the world,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64110,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from IBM to GE, to Bell Labs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67320,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "raced to create the blue LED."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70080,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They knew it would be worth billions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72930,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Despite the efforts of\nthousands of researchers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75660,
    "dDurationMs": 1473,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "nothing worked."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78000,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "10 years after Holonyak's original LED"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80580,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "turned into 20, then 30,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82830,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the hope of ever using\nLEDs for light, faded away."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86940,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "According to a director at Monsanto,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89190,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these won't ever replace\nthe kitchen light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92220,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They'd only be used in\nappliances, car dashboards,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94980,
    "dDurationMs": 3033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and stereo sets to see\nif the stereo was on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98970,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This might still be true\ntoday, if not for one engineer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102300,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who defied the entire industry"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104490,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and made three radical breakthroughs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106650,
    "dDurationMs": 2433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to create the world's first blue LED."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110802,
    "dDurationMs": 1798,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(dramatic music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112600,
    "dDurationMs": 3063,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Shūji Nakamura was a researcher\nat a small Japanese chemical"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115663,
    "dDurationMs": 2177,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "company named Nichia."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117840,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They had recently expanded\ninto the production"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119790,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of semiconductors to be\nused in the manufacture"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122280,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of red and green LEDs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124380,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But by the late 1980s,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125820,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the semiconductor division\nwas on its last legs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128460,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They were competing against\nfar more established"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130770,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "companies in a crowded\nmarket, and they were losing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134700,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tensions started to run high."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137130,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Younger employees begged\nNakamura to create new products,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140880,
    "dDurationMs": 3363,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "while senior workers called\nhis research a waste of money."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145730,
    "dDurationMs": 2533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And at Nichia, money was in short supply."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149100,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nakamura's lab mainly\nconsisted of machinery"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151590,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he had scavenged and\nwelded together himself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154590,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Phosphorus leaks in his lab\ncreated so many explosions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157860,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that his coworkers had\nstopped checking in on him."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160860,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By 1988, Nakamura's supervisors\nwere so disillusioned"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 164580,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with his research that\nthey told him to quit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167640,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it was out of desperation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169500,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that he brought a radical\nproposal to the company's founder"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172290,
    "dDurationMs": 2253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and president Nobuo Ogawa."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175640,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(dramatic music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176473,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The elusive blue LED,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178783,
    "dDurationMs": 2177,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the likes of of Sony,\nToshiba and Panasonic"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 180960,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "had all failed at."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182640,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What if Nichia could be\nthe one to create it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 186240,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After suffering loss after\nloss on their semiconductors"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189090,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for more than a decade,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190500,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ogawa took a gamble."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192450,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He devoted 500 million yen or $3 million,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196320,
    "dDurationMs": 3449,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "likely around 15% of the\ncompany's annual profit,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199769,
    "dDurationMs": 2568,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to Nakamura's moonshot Project."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204330,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Everyone knew that LEDs have the potential"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206700,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to replace light bulbs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208470,
    "dDurationMs": 4530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because light bulbs, the universal\nsymbol for a bright idea,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213000,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are actually terrible at making light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215850,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They work by running current\nthrough a tungsten filament,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218520,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which gets so hot, it glows."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220710,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But most of the electromagnetic radiation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223080,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "comes out as infrared, heat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225840,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Only a negligible\nfraction is visible light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229140,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In contrast, LED stands\nfor light emitting diode."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233160,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's right there in the name."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235140,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "LEDs primarily create light,\nso they're far more efficient,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239400,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and a diode is just a\ndevice with two electrodes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242430,
    "dDurationMs": 2703,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which only allows current\nto flow in one direction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246750,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So here's how an LED works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 249480,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you have an isolated atom,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251490,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "each electron in that atom\noccupies a discreet energy level."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255150,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can think of these energy\nlevels like individual seats"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257670,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from a hockey stadium,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259200,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and all atoms of the same element,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261120,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when they are far apart from each other"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262860,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have identical available energy levels."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265890,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when you bring multiple\natoms together to form a solid,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 268920,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "something interesting happens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270960,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The outermost electrons now feel the pole,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273210,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not only of their own nucleus,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275130,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but of all the other nuclei as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277800,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as a result, their\nenergy levels shift."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280950,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So instead of being identical,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282960,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they become a series of closely spaced,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285270,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but separate energy levels."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287160,
    "dDurationMs": 1792,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "An energy band."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 288952,
    "dDurationMs": 2648,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The highest energy band\nwith electrons in it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291600,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is known as the valence band,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293670,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the next higher energy band"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295080,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is called the conduction band."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296970,
    "dDurationMs": 2150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can think of it\nlike the balcony level."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300120,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In conductors, the valence\nband is only partially filled."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303660,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This means with a little\nbit of thermal energy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305820,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "electrons can jump into\nnearby unfilled seats,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 309090,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and if an electric field is applied,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310800,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they can jump from one\nunfilled seat to the next"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313380,
    "dDurationMs": 2050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and conduct current through the material."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316500,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In insulators, the valence band is full,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319530,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the difference in\nenergy between the valence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321480,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and conduction bands,\nthe band gap, is large."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325560,
    "dDurationMs": 4230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when an electric field is\napplied, no electrons can move."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329790,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are no available seats"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331350,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to move into in the valence band,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333330,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the band gap is too\nbig for any electrons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335640,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to jump into the conduction band,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 338070,
    "dDurationMs": 2373,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which brings us to semiconductors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341760,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Semiconductors are similar to insulators,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344010,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "except the band gap is much smaller."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346620,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This means at room temperature,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 348210,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a few electrons will\nhave sufficient energy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350850,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to jump into the conduction band,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 353040,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and now they can easily\naccess nearby empty"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355770,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "seats and conduct current."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357750,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not only that, the empty seats they left"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 359880,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "behind in the valence band can also move."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362550,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, really, it's the nearby electrons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364410,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "jumping into those empty seats."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 366150,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you look from afar,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367710,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's as though the empty seat or hole"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 370740,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is moving like a positive\ncharge in the opposite"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373770,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "direction to the electrons\nin the conduction band."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 377723,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(soft music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378556,
    "dDurationMs": 3734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By themselves, pure semiconductors\nare not that useful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382290,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To make them way more functional,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384300,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you have to add impurity\natoms into the lattice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387240,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is known as doping."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 389160,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, in silicon,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390510,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can add a small number\nof phosphorus atoms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393240,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Phosphorus is similar to silicon,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394800,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so it easily fits into the lattice,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 396960,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it brings with it one\nextra valence electron."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400170,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This electron exists in a donor level"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 402090,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just beneath the conduction band."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404310,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So with a bit of thermal energy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406080,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all these electrons can jump\ninto the conduction band"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408720,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and conduct current."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410610,
    "dDurationMs": 2689,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Since most of the charges that can move"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 413299,
    "dDurationMs": 1211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in this type of\nsemiconductor are electrons,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414510,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which are negative,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415890,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this sort of semiconductor\nis called n-type,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418620,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "n for negative,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420090,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I should point out\nthat the semiconductor"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421860,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "itself is still neutral."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423690,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's just that most of the mobile charge"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425550,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "carriers are negative."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 426930,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're electrons."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 428610,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there is also another type\nof semiconductor where most"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 430980,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the mobile charge\ncarriers are positive,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 432780,
    "dDurationMs": 1473,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's called p-type."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436320,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To make p-type silicon,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437580,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you add a small number\nof atoms of, say, boron."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 440580,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Boron fits into the lattice,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441840,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but brings with it one fewer\nvalence electron than silicon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445020,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it creates an empty acceptor level"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 447360,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just above the valence band."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449370,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And with a bit of thermal energy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 450720,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "electrons can jump outta the valence band,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452940,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "leaving behind holes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454950,
    "dDurationMs": 2627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is these positive holes\nwhich are mostly responsible"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 457577,
    "dDurationMs": 3463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for carrying current in\nthe p-type semiconductor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 461040,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Again, the material overall is uncharged,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 463560,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's just that most of\nthe mobile charge carriers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 466080,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are positive holes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468150,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Where things get interesting\nis when you put a piece"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 470430,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of p-type and n-type together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 472740,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Without even connecting this to a circuit,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 475170,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "some electrons will diffuse from n to p"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478140,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and fall into the holes in the p-type."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 481110,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This makes the p-type a\nlittle negatively charged,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483990,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the n-type a little\npositively charged."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 486690,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there is now an electric field"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488970,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "inside an inert piece of material."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 492210,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Electrons keep diffusing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 493860,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "until the electric field becomes so large,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496200,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it prevents them from crossing over."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 498510,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now we have established\nthe depletion region,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 501510,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an area depleted of\nmobile charge carriers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 504630,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are no electrons\nin the conduction band"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506790,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and no holes in the valence band."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 509340,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you connect a battery\nthe wrong way to this diode,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 511740,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it simply expands the depletion region"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 514230,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "until its electric field\nperfectly opposes that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 516960,
    "dDurationMs": 2853,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the battery and no current flows."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521490,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you flip the\npolarity of the battery,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 523680,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then the depletion region shrinks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525690,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the electric field decreases,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 527430,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and electrons can flow from n to p."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 530820,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When an electron falls from\nthe conduction band into a hole"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 534030,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the valence band, that\nband gap energy can be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537270,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "emitted as a photon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 539280,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The energy change of the\nelectron is emitted as light,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543150,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this is how a light\nemitting diode works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 546270,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The size of the band\ngap determines the color"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 549330,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the light emitted."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550830,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In pure silicon, the band gap\nis only 1.1 electron volts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 554910,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the photon released isn't\nvisible, it's infrared light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 558870,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These LEDs are actually\nused in remote controls"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 562050,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for your TV, and you can\ncapture them on camera."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 565770,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Moving up the spectrum, you\ncan see why the first visible"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 568500,
    "dDurationMs": 2754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "light LEDs were red and then green,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 571254,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and why blue was so hard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 573840,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A photon of blue light\nrequires more energy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 576300,
    "dDurationMs": 2313,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and therefore a larger band gap."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 579720,
    "dDurationMs": 990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the 1980s,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 580710,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "after hundreds of millions of\ndollars had been spent hunting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 584070,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the right material,\nevery electronics company"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 586890,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "had come up empty handed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 588690,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But researchers had at least figured out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 590430,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the first critical requirement,\nhigh quality crystal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 594600,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No matter what material\nyou used for the blue LED,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 597510,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it required a near\nperfect crystal structure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600450,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Any defects in the crystal lattice,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 602160,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "disrupt the flow of electrons."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 604140,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So instead of emitting their\nenergy as visible light,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 606600,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it is instead dissipated as heat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 609600,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the first step in\nNakamura's proposal to Ogawa,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 612720,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was to disappear to Florida."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 615150,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He knew an old colleague\nthere whose lab was beginning"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 617310,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to use a new crystal\nmaking technology called"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 619740,
    "dDurationMs": 2708,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Metal Organic Chemical Vapor Deposition,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 622448,
    "dDurationMs": 2005,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or MOCVD."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 625770,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "An MOCVD reactor,\nessentially a giant oven,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 629040,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was and still is the best way\nto mass produce clean crystal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 633660,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It works by injecting vapor molecules"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 636000,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of your crystal into a hot\nchamber where they react"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 638586,
    "dDurationMs": 3804,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with a base material called\na substrate to form layers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642390,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's important that the\nsubstrate lattice matches"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644580,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the crystal lattice\nbeing built on top of it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 646770,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to create a stable, smooth crystal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 649950,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a precise art."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 651930,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The crystal layers\noften need to be as thin"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 654270,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as just a couple of atoms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 656790,
    "dDurationMs": 3603,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nakamura joined the lab\nfor a year to master MOCVD."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 661410,
    "dDurationMs": 2103,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But his time there was miserable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 664380,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He wasn't allowed to\nuse the working MOCVD,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 667050,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so he spent 10 of his 12\nmonths assembling a new system,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 670470,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "almost from scratch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 672420,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even worse, his lab mates shunned him"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 675030,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because Nakamura didn't have a doctorate,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 677220,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "nor any academic papers to his name,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 679350,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as Nichia didn't allow publishing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 681840,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His lab mates, all PhD researchers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 684300,
    "dDurationMs": 2223,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "dismissed him as a lowly technician."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 687480,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This experience fueled him."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 689490,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nakamura wrote, \"I feel resentful"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 691680,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when people looked down on me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 693270,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I developed more fighting spirit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 695280,
    "dDurationMs": 3237,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I would not allow myself to\nbe beaten by such people.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 702007,
    "dDurationMs": 1301,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(inspirational music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 703308,
    "dDurationMs": 3132,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He returned to Japan in 1989\nwith two things in hand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 706440,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One, an order for a brand\nnew MOCVD reactor for Nichia,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 710760,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and two, a fervent desire to get his PhD."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 714450,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At that time in Japan,\nyou could earn a PhD"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716850,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "without having to go to university,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 718710,
    "dDurationMs": 2373,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "simply by publishing five papers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722010,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nakamura had always known his chances"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 724170,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of inventing the blue LED were low."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 726540,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But now he had a backup plan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 729030,
    "dDurationMs": 4410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even if he didn't succeed, he\ncould at least get his PhD."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 733440,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But now the question was\nwith MOCVD under his belt,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 737250,
    "dDurationMs": 2313,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which material should he research?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 741090,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By this time, scientists had\nnarrowed the options down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 743430,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to two main candidates, zinc\nselenide, and gallium nitride."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 747690,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These were both\nsemiconductors with band gaps,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 750240,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "theoretically, in the blue light range."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 753120,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Zinc selenide was the far\nmore promising option."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 756480,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When grown in an MOCVD reactor,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 758640,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it had only a .3% lattice mismatch"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 761670,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with its substrate, gallium arsenide."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 764040,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Therefore, zinc selenide\ncrystal had about a thousand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 766770,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "defects per square centimeter,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 768450,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "within the upper limit\nfor LED functioning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 771450,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Its only issue was that while scientists"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 773550,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "had figured out multiple different"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 774690,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ways to create n-type zinc selenide,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 777060,
    "dDurationMs": 2253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "no one knew how to create p-type."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 780570,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In contrast, gallium\nnitride had been abandoned"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 783330,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by almost everybody for three reasons."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 786270,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, it was much harder to\nmake a high quality crystal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 790050,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The best substrate for growing\ngallium nitride was sapphire,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 793620,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but its lattice mismatch was 16%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 796800,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This resulted in higher defects,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 799050,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over 10 billion per square centimeter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 802590,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second problem was\nthat like zinc selenide,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 805170,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "scientists had only ever created"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 806910,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "n-type gallium nitride using silicon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 809610,
    "dDurationMs": 1803,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "P-type was elusive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 812310,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And third, to be commercially viable,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 814620,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a blue LED would have to have\na total light output power"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 817770,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of at least a thousand microwatts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 820290,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's two orders"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 821670,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of magnitude more than any\nprototype had ever achieved."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 825630,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So between the two candidates,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 827400,
    "dDurationMs": 3363,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "almost all researchers were\nfocused on zinc selenide."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 831900,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nakamura surveyed the crowded field"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 833910,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and decided that if he were going"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 835380,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to publish five papers by himself,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 837690,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he'd better focus on gallium nitride,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 839880,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where the competition\nwas much less fierce."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 842790,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This material's main claim"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 844230,
    "dDurationMs": 4032,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to fame was one development back in 1972,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 848262,
    "dDurationMs": 3018,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when RCA engineer Herbert\nMaruska made a tiny"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 851280,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "gallium nitride blue LED, but\nit was dim and inefficient."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 855840,
    "dDurationMs": 4590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So RCA slashed the project's\nbudget, calling it a dead end."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 860430,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "20 years later, scientific\nopinion hadn't changed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 863520,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When Nakamura attended the\nbiggest applied physics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 865950,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "conference in Japan, the\ntalks on zinc selenide"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 868590,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "had over 500 attendees."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 870780,
    "dDurationMs": 3576,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The talks on gallium nitride had five."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 874356,
    "dDurationMs": 1841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(dramatic music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 876197,
    "dDurationMs": 2413,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Two of those five attendees\nwere the world experts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 878610,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on gallium nitride, Dr. Isamu Akasaki"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 881730,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and his former grad\nstudent, Dr. Hiroshi Amano."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 885210,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In contrast to Nakamura's\nacademic background,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 887820,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they were researchers\nat Nagoya University,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 890520,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one of Japan's best."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 892170,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A few years earlier, they\nhad made a breakthrough"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 894480,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the first problem of\nhigh quality crystal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 897840,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead of growing gallium\nnitride directly on sapphire,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 901080,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they first grew a buffer\nlayer of aluminum nitride."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 904890,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This has a lattice spacing in between that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 907230,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the other two\nmaterials, making it easier"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 909420,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to grow a clean gallium\nnitride crystal on top."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 912870,
    "dDurationMs": 2679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The only issue was that the\naluminum caused problems"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 915549,
    "dDurationMs": 2091,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the MOCVD reactor,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 917640,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "making the process hard to scale."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 920460,
    "dDurationMs": 3063,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Nakamura wasn't even\nclose at this stage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 924600,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Back at Nichia, he couldn't get\ngallium nitride to even grow"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 927720,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "normally in his new MOCVD reactor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 931440,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After six months, desperate for results,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 933870,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he decided to take the machine apart"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 935790,
    "dDurationMs": 2313,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and build a better version himself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 939360,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His 10 months spent putting\ntogether the reactor in Florida,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 942390,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were suddenly invaluable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 944520,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He began following the\nsame routine each day,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 947670,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "arrive at the lab at 7:00 AM."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 949860,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Spend the first half"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 950693,
    "dDurationMs": 3247,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the day welding, cutting,\nand rewiring the reactor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 953940,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Spend the rest of the day experimenting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 955770,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the modified reactor\nto see what it can do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 958920,
    "dDurationMs": 3723,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At 7:00 PM go home, eat\ndinner, wash and sleep."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 964053,
    "dDurationMs": 3447,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nakamura repeated this\nroutine every single day,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 967500,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "taking no weekends"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 968850,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and no holidays except for New Year's Day,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 971220,
    "dDurationMs": 2343,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the most important holiday in Japan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 974511,
    "dDurationMs": 1869,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(soft music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 976380,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After a year and a half\nof continuous work,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 979470,
    "dDurationMs": 4230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he came into the lab on a\nwinter day in late 1990."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 983700,
    "dDurationMs": 2115,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As usual, he tinkered\naround in the morning"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 985815,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "grew a gallium nitride\nsample in the afternoon,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 988568,
    "dDurationMs": 1728,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and tested it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 992010,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But this time, the electron\nmobility was four times higher"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 996390,
    "dDurationMs": 4470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than any gallium nitride ever\ngrown directly on sapphire."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1000860,
    "dDurationMs": 3783,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nakamura called it the most\nexciting day of his life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1005810,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His trick was to add a second nozzle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1008630,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the MOCVD reactor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1010850,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The gallium nitride reactant\ngases had been rising"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1013640,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the hot chamber,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1014810,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "mixing in the air to form a powdery waste."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1017930,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the second nozzle\nreleased a downward stream"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1020450,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of inert gas, pinning the\nfirst flow to the substrate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1023600,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to form a uniform crystal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1026030,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For years, scientists had\navoided adding a second stream"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1029150,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to MOCVD because they\nthought it would only"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1031250,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "introduce more turbulence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1033170,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Nakamura used a special nozzle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1035450,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that even when the streams combined,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1037670,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they remained laminar."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1039560,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He called his invention\nthe two-flow reactor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1043490,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, he was ready to take\non Akazaki and Amano,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1046760,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but instead of copying their\naluminum nitride buffer layer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1049790,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "his two flow design allowed\nhim to make gallium nitride"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1052550,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so smooth and stable,\nit itself could be used"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1056120,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as a buffer layer on\nthe sapphire substrate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1058700,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This in turn, yielded\nan even cleaner crystal"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1061640,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of gallium nitride on top,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1063530,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "without the issues of aluminum."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1066230,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nakamura now had the highest quality"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1068780,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "gallium nitride crystals ever made."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1071540,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But just as he was getting started,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1073640,
    "dDurationMs": 2138,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "things took a wrong turn."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1075778,
    "dDurationMs": 1522,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(dramatic music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1077300,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While he had been in Florida,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1078890,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nobuo Ogawa had stepped back\nfrom Nichia to become chairman."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1082820,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In his day, Nobuo had been\na risk taking scientist,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1085940,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "designing the company's first products."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1088010,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's why he supported Nakamura's\nlofty plans all this time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1091910,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But in his place, his\nson-in-law, Eji Ogawa,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1094970,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "became CEO of the company,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1097100,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the younger Ogawa had\na much stricter outlook."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1100190,
    "dDurationMs": 1537,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One Nichia client said,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1101727,
    "dDurationMs": 2033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"He has a mind of steel,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1103760,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he remembers everything.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1107030,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 1990, an executive at Matsushita,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1109850,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an LED manufacturer and\nNichia's biggest customer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1113540,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "visited the company to\ngive a talk on blue LEDs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1117140,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In it, he claimed zinc\nselenide was the way forward,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1120560,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "declaring \"gallium nitride has no future.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1124160,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That very same day, Nakamura\nreceived a note from Eji,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1127760,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "stop work on gallium nitride immediately."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1131780,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Eji had never supported the research"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1133760,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and wanted to end what he\nsaw as a colossal waste."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1137210,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Nakamura crumpled up\nthe note and threw it away,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1141410,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he did so again, and again,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1144470,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when a succession of similar notes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1146360,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and phone calls came\nfrom company management."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1149210,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Out of spite, he published his\nwork on the two-flow reactor"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1152360,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "without Nichia's knowledge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1154070,
    "dDurationMs": 2241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was his first paper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1156311,
    "dDurationMs": 2317,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One down, four to go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1160370,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With crystal formation settled,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1161990,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he turned to the second obstacle,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1164000,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "creating p-type gallium nitride."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1166730,
    "dDurationMs": 4290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here Akazaki and Amano had\nagain beaten him to the punch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1171020,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They had created a gallium\nnitride sample doped"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1173450,
    "dDurationMs": 2312,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with magnesium, but at first,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1175762,
    "dDurationMs": 3028,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it didn't perform as a\np-type as they expected."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1178790,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, after exposing\nit to an electron beam,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1181760,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it did behave as a p-type,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1184040,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the world's first p-type gallium nitride,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1186410,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "after 20 years of trying."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1189050,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The catch was that no\none knew why it worked."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1192860,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the process of\nirradiating each crystal"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1195230,
    "dDurationMs": 3273,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with electrons was too slow\nfor commercial production."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1200120,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At first, Nakamura copied\nAkazaki and Amano's approach,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1203780,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but he suspected the beam\nof electrons was overkill."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1206990,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Maybe all the crystal needed was energy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1209720,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So he tried heating magnesium\ndoped gallium nitride"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1212570,
    "dDurationMs": 4410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to 400 degrees Celsius in a\nprocess known as annealing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1216980,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The result, a completely p-type sample."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1220490,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This worked even better than\nthe shallow electron beam,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1223250,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which only made the surfaces\nof the samples p-type,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1226100,
    "dDurationMs": 4050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and simply heating things up\nwas a quick scalable process."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1230150,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His work also revealed why the\np-type had been so difficult."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1233990,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To make gallium nitride"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1235130,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with MOCVD, you supply\nthe nitrogen from ammonia,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1239000,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but ammonia also contains hydrogen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1241880,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Where there should have\nbeen holes in the magnesium"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1244220,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "doped gallium nitride,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1245660,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these hydrogen atoms were sneaking in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1247910,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and bonding with the magnesium,\nplugging all the holes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1251780,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Adding energy to the system,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1253310,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "released the hydrogen from the material,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1255530,
    "dDurationMs": 1893,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "freeing up the holes again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1259804,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(dramatic music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1260637,
    "dDurationMs": 2183,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By now, Nakamura had all the ingredients"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1262820,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to make a prototype blue LED,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1265040,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he presented it at a\nworkshop in St. Louis in 1992"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1269000,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and received a standing ovation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1271820,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was beginning to\nmake a name for himself,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1274940,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but even though he had created\nthe best prototype to date,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1278150,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it was more of a blue violet color"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1280340,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and still extremely inefficient,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1282650,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with a light output power"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1283910,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of just 42 microwatts,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1285920,
    "dDurationMs": 3843,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well below the 1000 microwatt\nthreshold for practical use."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1290660,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At Nichia, the new CEO's\npatience had run out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1294260,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Eji sent written orders to\nNakamura to stop tinkering"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1297590,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and turn whatever he had into a product."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1300590,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His job was on the line,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1302720,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but in Nakamura's own words,\n\"I kept ignoring his order."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1306530,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had been successful\nbecause I didn't listen"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1309050,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to company orders and\ntrusted my own judgment.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1312440,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At this point, he only\nhad the third hurdle left,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1315350,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "getting his blue LED\nto a light output power"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1317750,
    "dDurationMs": 1593,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of a thousand microwatts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1321178,
    "dDurationMs": 1102,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(soft music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1322280,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A known trick to increase\nthe efficiency of LEDs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1324920,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was to create a well,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1326870,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a thin layer of material\nat the p-n junction"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1329690,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "called an active layer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1331430,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that shrinks the band gap just a bit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1334460,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This encourages more electrons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1336200,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to fall from the end type\nconduction band into holes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1338930,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the p-type valence band."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1341060,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The best active layer for\ngallium nitride was already known"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1344150,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to be indium gallium nitride,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1346520,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which would not only make\nthe band gap easier to cross,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1349490,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but also narrow it just the right amount"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1351500,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to bring its blue violet\ngap down to true blue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1355280,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This time, Akasaki and\nAmano didn't scoop Nakamura."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1359150,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They were stuck trying to grow"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1360620,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "indium gallium nitride in the first place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1363290,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Amano recalled, \"It was generally\nsaid that gallium nitride"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1366680,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and indium nitride would not\nmix, like water and oil.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1370940,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Nakamura had an advantage,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1372980,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "his ability to customize\nhis MOCVD reactor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1376190,
    "dDurationMs": 2346,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This allowed him to use brute force,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1378536,
    "dDurationMs": 2844,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "adjusting the reactor\nto pump as much indium"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1381380,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as he could onto the gallium nitride,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1383630,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the hopes that at\nleast some would stick."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1386630,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To his surprise, the technique worked,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1389390,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "giving him a clean indium\ngallium nitride crystal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1392960,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He quickly incorporated this\nactive layer into his LED,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1396890,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the well worked a little too well"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1399380,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and overflowed with electrons,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1401570,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "leaking them back into the\ngallium nitride layers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1404600,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Unfazed, within a few months,\nNakamura had fixed this too"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1408080,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by creating the opposite\nof a well, a hill."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1411830,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He returned to his reactor one more time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1413810,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to make aluminum gallium nitride,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1416090,
    "dDurationMs": 2724,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a compound with a larger\nband gap that could block"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1418814,
    "dDurationMs": 3249,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "electrons from escaping\nthe well once inside."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1426104,
    "dDurationMs": 2826,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(dramatic music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1428930,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The structure of the blue LED\nhad become far more complex"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1432140,
    "dDurationMs": 4710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than anyone could have\nimagined, but it was complete."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1436850,
    "dDurationMs": 4083,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By 1992, Shūji Nakamura had this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1443270,
    "dDurationMs": 2017,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And I showed the chairman, I told him,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1445287,
    "dDurationMs": 2093,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Please, hey chairman come to my office.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1447380,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I showed him the blue LED"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1448850,
    "dDurationMs": 2494,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he said, \"ohh, this is great no?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1451344,
    "dDurationMs": 1516,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I became so happy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1452860,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I just became, out of my office, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1456740,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] After 30 years of searching"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1458420,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by countless scientists,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1460040,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nakamura had done it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1461720,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He had created a glorious, bright blue LED"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1464720,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that could even be seen in daylight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1467150,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It had a light output\npower of 1,500 microwatts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1471320,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and emitted a perfect blue\nat exactly 450 nanometers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1475820,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was over 100 times brighter"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1478010,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than the previous pseudo-blue\nLEDs on the market."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1481190,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nakamura wrote, \"I felt like I had reached"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1484040,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the top of Mount Fuji.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1486170,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nichia called a press conference in Tokyo"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1488240,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to announce the world's\nfirst true blue LED."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1491990,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The electronics industry was stunned."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1494720,
    "dDurationMs": 2107,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A researcher from Toshiba remarked,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1496827,
    "dDurationMs": 2693,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Everyone was caught\nwith their pants down.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1499520,
    "dDurationMs": 4290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The effect on Nichia's fortunes\nwas immediate and explosive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1503810,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Orders flooded in,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1505190,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and by the end of 1994,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1506810,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they were manufacturing 1\nmillion blue LEDs per month."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1511790,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Within three years,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1512990,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the company's revenue had nearly doubled."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1515780,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 1996, they made the\njump from blue to white,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1519050,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by placing a yellow phosphor over the LED."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1522680,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This chemical absorbs the blue photons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1525020,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and re-radiates them in a broad spectrum"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1527540,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "across the visible range."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1529370,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Soon enough, Nichia\nwas selling the world's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1531560,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "first white LED."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1533570,
    "dDurationMs": 4445,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At last, unlocking the final\nfrontiers so many had doubted,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1538015,
    "dDurationMs": 1305,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "LED lighting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1540800,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Over the next four years,\ntheir sales doubled again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1544400,
    "dDurationMs": 4860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By 2001, their revenue was\napproaching $700 million a year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1549260,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Over 60% came from blue LED products."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1553610,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today, Nichia is one of the\nlargest LED manufacturers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1556850,
    "dDurationMs": 3453,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the world with an annual\nrevenue in the billions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1561320,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As for Nakamura, to whom Nichia owed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1564650,
    "dDurationMs": 2133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the quadrupling of its fortunes?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1568719,
    "dDurationMs": 1062,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(dramatic music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1569781,
    "dDurationMs": 2802,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I increased my salary, $60,000."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1572583,
    "dDurationMs": 2177,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After doubling, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1574760,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I heard you only got $170 bonus"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1577190,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Each patent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1578750,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So you got $170 bonus for the patent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1581000,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yes, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1582260,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] This was all while the blue LED"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1584360,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was generating hundreds of\nmillions of dollars in sales."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1588320,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Eji Ogawa had always seen\nNakamura's stubborn individuality"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1592010,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as a liability, not a strength."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1594320,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The message was clear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1596300,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 2000, after more\nthan 20 years at Nichia,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1599750,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nakamura left the company for the US,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1602000,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where job offers had been pouring in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1604790,
    "dDurationMs": 2193,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But his troubles with Nichia weren't over."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1607820,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He began consulting for\nCree, another LED company."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1611300,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nichia was furious and sued him\nfor leaking company secrets."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1615620,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nakamura responded by counter-suing Nichia"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1618170,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for never properly compensating\nhim for his invention,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1621200,
    "dDurationMs": 2263,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "seeking $20 million."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1625121,
    "dDurationMs": 3789,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 2001, the Japanese\ncourts ruled with Nakamura"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1628910,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and ordered Nichia to pay him\n10 times his initial request."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1632930,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Nichia appealed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1634400,
    "dDurationMs": 1543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the case was eventually settled"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1635943,
    "dDurationMs": 2313,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with a payout of $8 million."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1639590,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the end, this was only enough"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1641300,
    "dDurationMs": 1983,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to cover Nakamura's legal fees."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1644664,
    "dDurationMs": 2066,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(soft music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1646730,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is all he got for an invention"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1649430,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that now comprises an\n$80 billion industry,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1653270,
    "dDurationMs": 2193,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from house lights to streetlights."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1656840,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While you watch this video\non a phone, computer or TV."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1660200,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you're outside following\ntraffic lights or displays,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1663500,
    "dDurationMs": 3843,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "chances are you are relying on blue LEDs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1670580,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We might even be getting too much of them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1673070,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You may have heard warnings to\navoid blue light from screens"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1676250,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "before bed because it can\ndisrupt your circadian rhythm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1679640,
    "dDurationMs": 3543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That all comes from the\ngallium nitride blue LED."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1685310,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But as for lighting, there\nare virtually no downsides"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1688460,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to an LED bulb."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1690020,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Compared to an incandescent\nor fluorescent bulb,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1692660,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they are far more efficient."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1694370,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They last many times\nlonger, are safer to handle,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1697460,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and are completely customizable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1699680,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "30 years after the first white LED,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1702230,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "high-end bulbs today"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1703400,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "allow you to choose between 50,000"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1706130,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "different shades of white."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1708470,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most importantly, their price\nhas come down to only a couple"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1711680,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of dollars more than other types of bulbs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1714440,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And at their efficiency,\nwith average daily use"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1717350,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and electricity pricing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1718700,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can recoup that\ncost in only two months"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1721550,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and continue to save for years after that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1724220,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The result is a lighting revolution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1727280,
    "dDurationMs": 3315,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 2010, just 1% of\nresidential lighting sales"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1730595,
    "dDurationMs": 1995,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the world were LED."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1732590,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 2022, it was over half."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1736040,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Experts estimate that\nwithin the next 10 years,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1738410,
    "dDurationMs": 3213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "nearly all lighting sales will be LED."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1742531,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(soft music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1743364,
    "dDurationMs": 2486,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The energy savings will be enormous."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1745850,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Lighting accounts for 5%\nof all carbon emissions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1749600,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A full switch to LEDs could\nsave an estimated 1.4 billion"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1753260,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tons of CO2,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1754820,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "equivalent to taking almost half the cars"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1757220,
    "dDurationMs": 1743,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the world off the road."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1761300,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today, Nakamura's research\nis on the next generation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1764030,
    "dDurationMs": 3903,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of LEDs, micro LEDs, and UV LEDs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1768950,
    "dDurationMs": 2615,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] So what are\nthey making in there?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1771565,
    "dDurationMs": 2815,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- LEDs, lasers, power devices."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1774380,
    "dDurationMs": 2930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is one the best facility in the US."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1777310,
    "dDurationMs": 1783,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And this is because of you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1781580,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's a standard LED size?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1783530,
    "dDurationMs": 2647,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Shūji] 300 times 200 microns."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1786177,
    "dDurationMs": 893,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1787070,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Shūji] Smallest is five microns."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1789410,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] That is insanely tiny."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1791683,
    "dDurationMs": 1537,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So basically you can use that for like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1793220,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "near-eye display such as AR and VR."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1795770,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You could have like a retina display"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1797120,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's like right up here?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1798230,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yep."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1799063,
    "dDurationMs": 1117,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- A human hair would be about that thick."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1800180,
    "dDurationMs": 990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Shūji] Yep."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1801170,
    "dDurationMs": 1953,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And that's a really, really tiny LED."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1804530,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "UV LEDs could be used to\nsterilize surfaces like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1807080,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in hospitals or kitchens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1808640,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just flick on the UV lights"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1810080,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and pathogens would be dead in seconds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1812990,
    "dDurationMs": 1490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- COVID-19, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1814480,
    "dDurationMs": 2650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "UV LED companies' stock prices were going,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1817130,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "skyrocketed because\neveryone expected to be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1819260,
    "dDurationMs": 2521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "using these UV LEDS."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1821781,
    "dDurationMs": 2857,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We can sterilize all the COVID-19, no?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1824638,
    "dDurationMs": 3257,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For emitting diode, we use\nindium gallium nitride."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1827895,
    "dDurationMs": 2473,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For UV, we use aluminum gallium nitride."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1830368,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Derek] Okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1831201,
    "dDurationMs": 2278,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Shūji] 'Cause the\nband gap is much bigger."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1833479,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Do you think\nthis is what's coming?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1835259,
    "dDurationMs": 2504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Shūji] It's okay, it work,\nbut the problem is the cost."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1838755,
    "dDurationMs": 2003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The efficiency is less than 10%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1840758,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The cost is very high."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1842731,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if the efficiency\nbecomes more than 50%,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1845131,
    "dDurationMs": 2269,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cost is almost comparable\nto the mercury lamp."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1847400,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] And you think\nit will happen, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1848960,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like the efficiency will go up?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1850580,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Shūji] Yeah, yeah, I think so."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1851413,
    "dDurationMs": 1087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's just a matter of time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1852500,
    "dDurationMs": 923,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, I think so."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1854540,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] And he's even tackling one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1855920,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the biggest challenges of our time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1858260,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Shūji] I'm interested in physics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1859700,
    "dDurationMs": 930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Me too!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1860630,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I'm still interested in nuclear fusion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1862490,
    "dDurationMs": 2928,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So recently I started the\ncompany of nuclear fusion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1865418,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1866251,
    "dDurationMs": 1576,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Oh yeah, last year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1867827,
    "dDurationMs": 1917,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- No way.\n- No way, aha."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1871014,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(soft music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1871847,
    "dDurationMs": 2733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- In 2014, Nakamura, Akasaki and Amano"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1874580,
    "dDurationMs": 3001,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were awarded the Nobel Prize in physics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1877581,
    "dDurationMs": 1739,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for creating the blue LED."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1879320,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Shortly afterwards, Nakamura\npublicly thanked Nichia"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1882350,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for supporting his work,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1883820,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he offered to visit and make amends,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1886130,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they turned down his offer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1888770,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and today their\nrelationship is still cold."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1891950,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But perhaps even more\nimportant than the Nobel Prize,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1895040,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the time Nakamura released\nhis blue LED in 1994,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1898610,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he had published over 15 papers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1900890,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he finally received his\ndoctorate in engineering."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1904700,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today he has published over 900 papers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1908780,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Throughout his entire journey,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1911210,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one thing has never changed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1913340,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What is your favorite color?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1915530,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Oh, blue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1918980,
    "dDurationMs": 930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Was it always blue?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1919910,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or only after you made the LED?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1921440,
    "dDurationMs": 2527,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I was born in a fishing village."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1923967,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fishing village."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1924800,
    "dDurationMs": 2548,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In front of the house\nis awesome like, ocean."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1927348,
    "dDurationMs": 1083,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Blue always."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1932990,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- While I was learning\nabout Nakamura's story,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1935210,
    "dDurationMs": 2172,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I realized that what set\nhim apart from the thousands"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1937382,
    "dDurationMs": 3018,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of researchers trying\nto unlock the blue LED,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1940400,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it wasn't necessarily his knowledge,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1942290,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but his determination, critical thinking,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1944750,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and problem solving skills."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1946400,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Where others saw dead ends,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1947930,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he saw potential solutions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1949970,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you're looking for a free"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1951290,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and easy way to start\nbuilding these skills"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1953180,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for yourself right now,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1954710,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "look no further than\ntoday's sponsor, Brilliant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1957470,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Brilliant will make you a better thinker"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1959330,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and problem solver while\nhelping you build real skills"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1961880,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and everything from math"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1963350,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and data science, to\nprogramming technology,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1965960,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you name it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1967190,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On Brilliant, you'll\nlearn through discovery"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1969260,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by trying things for yourself,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1970910,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you'll not only gain knowledge"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1972440,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of key concepts, but learn to apply them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1974570,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to real world situations, all\nwhile building your intuition,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1978320,
    "dDurationMs": 870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "giving you the tools"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1979190,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to solve whatever problems come your way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1981710,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is so much to learn on Brilliant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1983810,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They have thousands"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1984950,
